    {
      "id": "97208a25-deaa-4507-a4eb-dc6774c91109",
      "name": "AI Agent - Diagnose Root Cause & Propose Remediation",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        -4192,
        5088
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a senior SRE diagnosing a Kubernetes failure.\n\nCluster: {{ $json.clusterName }} | Namespace: {{ $json.namespace }} | Resource: {{ $json.resourceKind }}/{{ $json.resourceName }}\nAlert reason: {{ $json.alertReason }}\n\nEvents:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.events) }}\n\nRecent logs:\n{{ $json.recentLogs }}\n\nResource usage:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.resourceUsage) }}\n\nDeployment/replica state:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.deploymentState) }}\n\nDiagnose the most likely root cause. Propose ONE concrete remediation action from this set: 'restart_pod', 'delete_pod', 'bump_replicas_within_limit', 'scale_deployment', 'cordon_node', 'drain_node', 'rollback_deployment', 'increase_resource_limits', 'no_action_investigate_further'. Assess riskLevel for that specific action as 'Safe' (reversible, single-resource, no data-loss risk) or 'NeedsApproval' (affects node scheduling, scales down capacity, deletes persistent state, or you are not highly confident in the diagnosis).\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object (no markdown fences, no commentary) with keys: rootCauseHypothesis (2-3 sentences), confidence ('High'|'Medium'|'Low'), proposedActionType (one of the action set above), proposedActionDetails (string, the specific command/target, e.g. 'restart pod my-app-7f9c-abcd in namespace prod'), riskLevel ('Safe'|'NeedsApproval'), riskReasoning (one short sentence).",
        "options": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "9b99f320-9852-42c2-8030-35004734f9f4",
      "name": "Anthropic - Diagnostics Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "position": [
        -4128,
        5328
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
